And it's not just about the content.

724
00:28:16,240 --> 00:28:16,500
Right.

725
00:28:16,540 --> 00:28:18,030
It's also about the delivery.

726
00:28:18,050 --> 00:28:18,380
OK.

727
00:28:18,440 --> 00:28:22,170
Things like eye contact and gestures and even humor.

728
