745
00:28:42,480 --> 00:28:46,610
So how do we make sure the meetings we attend or even lead are valuable?

746
00:28:47,110 --> 00:28:48,730
Well, it starts with preparation.

747
00:28:48,750 --> 00:28:48,950
Okay.

748
00:28:48,970 --> 00:28:51,580
Whether you're organizing the meeting or just attending.

749
00:28:51,840 --> 00:28:52,020
Right.

750
00:28:52,240 --> 00:28:54,020
It's so important to come prepared.

751
00:28:54,520 --> 00:28:56,500
So no more showing up and winging it.

752
00:28:56,680 --> 00:28:56,740
No.

753
00:28:57,280 --> 00:28:58,220
Definitely not.

754
00:28:58,240 --> 00:28:58,340
Okay.

755
00:28:58,440 --> 00:28:59,040
Be prepared.

756
00:28:59,080 --> 00:28:59,840
Be prepared.

757
00:28:59,860 --> 00:29:01,400
It shows respect for everybody's time.

758
00:29:01,440 --> 00:29:01,920
Right.

759
00:29:01,940 --> 00:29:03,550
And you can contribute more meaningfully.

760
00:29:03,610 --> 00:29:03,900
Okay.

761
