Arrive a few minutes early.

763
00:29:06,690 --> 00:29:07,030
Okay.

764
00:29:07,130 --> 00:29:08,430
It gives you a chance to settle in.

765
00:29:08,470 --> 00:29:08,850
Right.

766
00:29:09,050 --> 00:29:09,850
Review your notes.

767
00:29:10,190 --> 00:29:10,310
Right.

768
00:29:10,470 --> 00:29:12,280
Maybe chat with some of the other participants.

769
00:29:12,300 --> 00:29:13,780
Create some more relaxed atmosphere.

770
00:29:13,920 --> 00:29:14,520
Exactly.

771
00:29:14,540 --> 00:29:14,800
All right.

772
00:29:14,820 --> 00:29:17,840
So once the meeting starts, active listening is key.

773
00:29:18,220 --> 00:29:18,820
Oh, absolutely.

774
00:29:18,860 --> 00:29:19,420
Pay attention.

775
00:29:19,660 --> 00:29:20,020
Yeah.

776
00:29:20,040 --> 00:29:20,940
Ask questions.

777
00:29:20,960 --> 00:29:21,380
Take notes.

778
00:29:21,610 --> 00:29:23,070
And don't be afraid to speak up.

779
00:29:23,320 --> 00:29:25,090
No speak up if you have something to add.

780
00:29:25,170 --> 00:29:25,470
Right.

781
00:29:26,200 --> 00:29:27,780
Meetings are for collaboration.

782
00:29:27,940 --> 00:29:28,340
Yeah.

783
00:29:28,560 --> 00:29:30,120
