Exactly.

793
00:29:45,140 --> 00:29:50,970
Like, I understand your point, but have we considered the impact on this or that?

794
00:29:51,150 --> 00:29:51,510
Perfect.

795
00:29:51,670 --> 00:29:51,890
Okay.

796
00:29:51,950 --> 00:29:54,110
So be assertive but respectful.

797
00:29:54,330 --> 00:29:54,570
Yes.

798
00:29:55,130 --> 00:29:56,960
And sometimes you just have to agree to disagree.

799
00:29:56,980 --> 00:29:57,140
Exactly.

800
