804
00:30:04,460 --> 00:30:04,680
Okay.

805
00:30:04,700 --> 00:30:06,590
Well, leading a meeting is a different skill set.

806
00:30:06,610 --> 00:30:06,710
Okay.

807
00:30:07,110 --> 00:30:07,890
