813
00:30:14,060 --> 00:30:14,360
No.

814
00:30:14,380 --> 00:30:14,780
Okay.

815
00:30:14,800 --> 00:30:16,880
And time management is really important.

816
00:30:16,900 --> 00:30:17,220
Right.

817
00:30:17,340 --> 00:30:18,680
Start and end on time.

818
00:30:19,080 --> 00:30:22,260
