819
00:30:22,330 --> 00:30:24,590
And build in some buffer time for interruption.

820
00:30:24,750 --> 00:30:25,730
Oh, that's a great idea.

821
00:30:25,770 --> 00:30:26,290
Yeah.

822
00:30:26,770 --> 00:30:28,020
And encourage participation.

823
00:30:28,100 --> 00:30:28,840
From everyone.

824
00:30:29,340 --> 00:30:29,580
Yes.

825
00:30:29,800 --> 00:30:32,780
