00:31:34,030 --> 00:31:35,830
It requires a special set of skills.

857
00:31:36,010 --> 00:31:36,230
Yeah.

858
00:31:36,390 --> 00:31:37,410
And the principles are the same.

859
00:31:37,590 --> 00:31:38,040
Okay.

860
00:31:38,060 --> 00:31:40,080
It's about understanding the needs of both parties.

861
00:31:40,240 --> 00:31:40,500
Right.

862
00:31:40,800 --> 00:31:43,520
