889
00:32:16,410 --> 00:32:21,040
So even if there's tension, it's important to maintain respect.

890
00:32:21,060 --> 00:32:21,540
Absolutely.

891
00:32:21,560 --> 00:32:23,040
And that starts with active listening.

892
00:32:23,500 --> 00:32:23,720
Right.

893
00:32:24,000 --> 00:32:25,600
